","Shareholder yield of 3.2% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.6) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Payout ratio of 700% leaves essentially no coverage if earnings wobble","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Interest-rate sensitivity and tenant-credit risk \u2014 cap rates and refinancing costs move faster than the 10-year leases can absorb.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Remote work structural vacancy \u2014 the post-pandemic shift to hybrid work has permanently impaired demand for urban office space across most markets.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Climate and insurance cost escalation \u2014 rising premiums and coverage withdrawals in flood/fire zones are repricing assets that the market once treated as perpetuities.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 48% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Valued at a 30% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Among the least levered in Real Estate \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Empire State Realty OP (ESBA) Reports Third Quarter Earnings, Is The Undervaluation Too Cheap To Ignore?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/real-estate/nysearca-esba/empire-state-realty-op/news/empire-state-realty-op-esba-reports-third-quarter-earnings-i","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794558510.692,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.936,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},